# KonouzImmobilier CRM — Database Design

## Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    USERS {
        int id PK
        string nom
        string prenom
        string email
        string password_hash
        enum role
        bool actif
        datetime created_at
    }

    PROMOTEURS {
